      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "00004_aogu_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{不安|ふあん}→不安：00836_fuan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{扇|あお}る⟦{報道|ほうどう}→報道：04438_houdou⟧。",
      "english": "News coverage that stirs up anxiety.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "00004_aogu_ex4",
      "japanese": "{夏祭|なつまつ}りの{夜|よる}、{浴衣|ゆかた}{姿|すがた}の{女性|じょせい}がうちわで{涼|すず}しそうに{扇|あお}いでいた。",
      "english": "On the night of the summer festival, a woman in a yukata was fanning herself to cool down.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "00004_aogu_ex5",
      "japanese": "SNSで{対立|たいりつ}を{扇|あお}る{書|か}き{込|こ}みが{増|ふ}えている。",
      "english": "Posts that stir up conflict on social media are increasing.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "00004_aogu_ex6",
      "japanese": "{彼|かれ}は{群衆|ぐんしゅう}の{怒|いか}りを{扇|あお}って、デモに{発展|はってん}させた。",
      "english": "He incited the crowd's anger and escalated it into a demonstration.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "{扇|あお}ぐ means to fan or create air movement.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: {顔|かお}を{扇|あお}ぐ\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- うちわで{扇|あお}ぐ: to fan with a paper fan\n- {火|ひ}を{扇|あお}ぐ: to fan a fire\n- {不安|ふあん}を{扇|あお}る: to stir up anxiety\n\nUSAGE:\n{扇|あお}る can mean to incite or inflame (emotions, conflict). In this sense, it's often written as {煽|あお}る.\n\nNOTE: Don't confuse with {仰|あお}ぐ (to look up at, to respect).",
